# Event$ TurnFaceUp | ReplaceWith$ MorphChoice (DB$ GenericChoice, branches
# BigTough = DB$ Clone | SetPower$ 1 | SetToughness$ 5, BigPower = 5/1). Soul
# Summons manifests Aquamorph Entity, Ixidor turns it face up, and Card.
# turnFaceUp runs the replacement once it is face up. The human picks branch 0,
# the 1/5, so a Lightning Bolt does not kill it.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 W
tapformana human 3 W
queue paygeneric W
castspell human 1
resolvestack
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
tapformana human 6 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue targets 8
queue abilitychoice 0
queue action human activate 7 0
passpriority
resolvestack
tapformana human 10 R
queue targets 8
queue action human cast 11
passpriority
